{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HJxeYNwR8h9QSX5S1tAZUm","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Regex Validator\n2\t\n3\t## Goal\n4\tBuild a browser-based, dark-mode regex testing tool with a 3-panel layout: text input, regex input, and a reference panel with language-specific formatting tabs.\n5\t\n6\t## Scope\n7\t- **In scope:**\n8\t  - Left panel: multi-line text editor where the user pastes target text\n9\t  - Right-top panel: regex input field with live match highlighting in the left panel\n10\t  - Right-bottom panel: informational reference (syntax cheatsheet + tabs for JS, Python, Go, Java, etc.)\n11\t  - \"Escape for JSON\" button that reformats the current regex into a JSON-safe escaped string\n12\t  - Dark mode as the default (and only) theme\n13\t- **Out of scope:**\n14\t  - Backend / server-side processing — all matching runs in the browser\n15\t  - Saving or sharing regex snippets\n16\t  - Regex flavor differences in matching (engine used is JS `RegExp`)\n17\t\n18\t## Getting Started\n19\tTBD — fill in once prototype is scaffolded.\n20\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"fa55bf36-c1c4-4f7d-8124-96a13dbf10eb","uuid":"65b9f733-accf-4a80-bb34-3e0699f7867a","timestamp":"2026-04-24T10:26:24.922Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/sysoper/workspace/WhileISleep/batch-output/regex-validator/README.md","content":"# Regex Validator\n\n## Goal\nBuild a browser-based, dark-mode regex testing tool with a 3-panel layout: text input, regex input, and a reference panel with language-specific formatting tabs.\n\n## Scope\n- **In scope:**\n  - Left panel: multi-line text editor where the user pastes target text\n  - Right-top panel: regex input field with live match highlighting in the left panel\n  - Right-bottom panel: informational reference (syntax cheatsheet + tabs for JS, Python, Go, Java, etc.)\n  - \"Escape for JSON\" button that reformats the current regex into a JSON-safe escaped string\n  - Dark mode as the default (and only) theme\n- **Out of scope:**\n  - Backend / server-side processing — all matching runs in the browser\n  - Saving or sharing regex snippets\n  - Regex flavor differences in matching (engine used is JS `RegExp`)\n\n## Getting Started\nTBD — fill in once prototype is scaffolded.\n","numLines":20,"startLine":1,"totalLines":20}}}
