{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_018zUvq5BAnuJpZTGgAGMpPP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01FoJVvCLHLS7w3eB5o6gY7x","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/home/sysoper/workspace/WhileISleep/batch-output/regex-validator/README.md","content":"# Regex Validator\n\n## Goal\nBuild a browser-based, dark-mode regex testing tool with a 3-panel layout: text input, regex input, and a reference panel with language-specific formatting tabs.\n\n## Scope\n- **In scope:**\n  - Left panel: multi-line contenteditable text editor where the user pastes target text\n  - Right-top panel: regex input field with live match highlighting in the left panel\n  - Right-bottom panel: informational reference (full syntax tables + tabs for JS, Python, Go, Java, PCRE)\n  - \"Escape for JSON\" button that shows a modal with the JSON-escaped pattern string and a copy button\n  - Dark mode as the default (and only) theme\n- **Out of scope:**\n  - Backend / server-side processing — all matching runs in the browser\n  - Saving or sharing regex snippets\n  - Regex flavor differences in matching (engine used is JS `RegExp`)\n\n## Getting Started\n\nOpen `index.html` directly in any modern browser — no build step, no server required.\n\n```\nopen index.html        # macOS\nxdg-open index.html    # Linux\nstart index.html       # Windows\n```\n\nOr serve locally:\n```\nnpx http-server . -p 8080\n```\n\n## Features\n- Live match highlighting with debounce (150ms) as you type\n- All matches highlighted simultaneously in amber\n- Flag toggle buttons (g, i, m, s, u) plus a direct flags text input\n- Error display when the regex is invalid\n- Match count badge (\"3 matches\" / \"no matches\")\n- \"Escape for JSON\" modal showing `JSON.stringify`-escaped pattern with copy button\n- Full syntax reference tables for: JavaScript, Python, Go (RE2), Java, PCRE\n\n## To Do\n- Add language-specific escape button variants (e.g., Python raw string `r\"…\"`, Go backtick string) in the JSON-escape modal\n- Add match group inspector showing capture group values per match\n- Add regex permalink / share via URL hash (localStorage optional)\n- Highlight current match on step-through (next/previous buttons)\n- Add POSIX flavor reference tab\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":145,"cache_read_input_tokens":33014,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":145},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"fa55bf36-c1c4-4f7d-8124-96a13dbf10eb","uuid":"fdb3976d-74ae-4785-96b5-aed0879d3d79"}
